(
    title: "Cabbage Patch Kids: Adventures in the Park",
    description: Some("Anna Lee sets out for some exercise in the park and runs into a string of obstacles. Each level is ten scenes against the clock: leap onto vines, clear water-filled pits, ride floating platforms, and avoid bouncing balls, bees and fires. Bounce on well-placed trampolines to grab bonus objects hidden in the trees."),
